---
title: Sequence diagram - staff change a case stage
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Admin or consultant
    participant W as Web portal<br/>CasesPage.jsx, CaseStageSection.jsx
    participant MW as API pipeline<br/>JWT bearer + role check
    participant CC as CasesController
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>Case, CaseStageHistory, AuditLog

    S->>W: opens a case, chooses a stage in the list
    Note over W: every stage is offered except the current one
    alt no stage chosen
        W-->>S: "Choose a stage", nothing sent
    else stage chosen
        W->>MW: PATCH /api/cases/{id}/stage {stage}
        alt token missing or expired
            MW-->>W: 401, refresh once and retry
        else role is Client
            MW-->>W: 403
        else Admin or Consultant
            MW->>CC: UpdateStage(id, request)
            alt stage missing or not a CaseStage name
                CC-->>W: 400
            else
                CC->>DB: Cases.FindAsync(id)
                alt case not found
                    CC-->>W: 404 "Case not found."
                else consultant is not the assigned consultant
                    CC-->>W: 403
                else allowed
                    CC->>DB: UPDATE Case.Stage, UpdatedAt
                    CC->>DB: INSERT CaseStageHistory (FromStage, ToStage, ChangedById)
                    CC->>DB: INSERT AuditLog ("UpdateCaseStage", Case)
                    CC-->>W: 200 "Stage updated."
                    W-->>S: toast, list and panel reload
                end
            end
        end
    end
    Note over CC,DB: Not checked: stage order (any jump forward or back is accepted),<br/>archived cases, or a change to the same stage
